<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Penoles gives 6 mo metal volumes.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Penoles gives 6 mo metal volumes.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrias Penoles, the world's largest refined silver producer, detailed on Tuesday its production volumes of precious and base metals in the first half of the year.</p>
<p>Gold in kilograms, silver and base metals in tonnes.</p>
<p>    Metal		H1 1997	 H1  1996</p>
<p>    Gold		   4,530	    3,995</p>
<p>    Silver		   933.5	    815.3</p>
<p>    Lead		  87,855	   74,539</p>
<p>    Zinc		  61,678	   59,075</p>
<p>((--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903))</p>
</text>
